   o  *trice corpse:  stoning attack.

   o  Fire trap or bear trap:  "You sit down on the OW! OW! OW!
      --more--  You quickly stand up again."  Double damage for 
      males.  Males are caught by bear traps.

   o  Bag of Tricks:  grows an enormous set of teeth and bites you.
