Implications:  

	You don't get an extra 4-5 points of AC during the end game,
since this doesn't add a new armor slot.  It would be more realistic
if it did, but I don't want to have to rebalance the game for some-
thing this minor.

	When you're swapping from a breech clout to, say, leather
